  description: 'Three hard laps on the ledges of Daredevil Peak. Two trick jumps a lap: off the lip time slows down - swipe the tricks shown, fast and in the right order (left or right to spin, up for a front flip, down for a back flip), or you come down short into the chasm! Narrow ledges, glare ice on the hairpins, a long drop either side of the ridge and the needle bridge, the squiggly cliff road down the face of the mountain and the knife-edge descent home (boulders, a crevasse, ice before the last hairpin) - fall off and you are going down!'
